# Both of Preacher of the Schism's attack triggers on one attack: the players are tied at 20, so the attacked player is
# "tied for most life" (a token: a 1/1 white Vampire with lifelink) and its controller is too (draw a card, lose 1 life).
# Combat damage is the Preacher's 2 into Bot2 (the token came in after attackers were declared, so it is not attacking).

